# ============================================
# IPLogger.icu — 301 Redirect Rules
# Purpose: Eliminate keyword cannibalization
# ============================================

# --------------------------------------------------
# www → non-www (canonical domain)
#
# WARNING: this rule does NOT work on Cloudflare Pages.
# Cloudflare does not support domain-level redirects in _redirects
# (source must be a path; hostnames are never matched), and the `!`
# force flag is Netlify-only syntax. If the site is on Cloudflare
# Pages, configure this as a Bulk Redirect / Redirect Rule in the
# dashboard instead — otherwise www and non-www stay duplicated.
# --------------------------------------------------
https://www.iplogger.icu/* https://iplogger.icu/:splat 301!

